parts of the problem.

05:37.710 --> 05:40.023
If you weren't graphing it
while recording a video, it

05:40.023 --> 05:41.080
probably would be a
little bit faster.

05:44.470 --> 05:45.305
That should be good enough.

05:48.760 --> 05:49.920
What are our data points?

05:49.920 --> 06:03.800
We have 1, 2, 3,
4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9.

06:03.800 --> 06:04.930
You don't have do it so neatly.

06:04.930 --> 06:06.690
Well it's good to do it neatly
