06:08.600 --> 06:12.640
And let's see, how high
should my L values?

06:12.640 --> 06:14.272
This is time right here.

06:14.272 --> 06:18.250
This is my L of t axis.

06:18.250 --> 06:21.180
It goes up to about, 176
