06:24.040 --> 06:28.270
Let's say this is 200.

06:28.270 --> 06:33.410
So halfway up would be 100.

06:33.410 --> 06:37.320
This would be 150.

06:37.320 --> 06:39.770
This would be 50.

06:39.770 --> 06:41.080
I don't know what
that sound was from.

06:41.080 --> 06:42.370
But let's keep going forward.

06:42.370 --> 06:44.570
Let's plot the points.

06:44.570 --> 06:47.260
At t equals 0 there are
120 people in line.

06:47.260 --> 06:48.910
That's about right there.

06:48.910 --> 06:51.520
At t equals 1, 156.

06:51.520 --> 06:52.630
I'm just approximating.

06:52.630 --> 06:54.280
It's about right there.

06:54.280 --> 06:57.180
At t equals 3-- they skip
