07:30.220 --> 07:31.660
Let's connect those points.

07:31.660 --> 07:33.681
Connect the dots.

07:33.681 --> 07:36.850
So from here to there.

07:36.850 --> 07:39.490
And from there to there.

07:39.490 --> 07:41.890
There to there.

07:41.890 --> 07:45.240
There to there, almost done.

07:45.240 --> 07:49.570
OK so we've at least plotted
the sample points and

07:49.570 --> 07:51.160
